  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "つうじょうの　とくせいを　もつ\nポケモンに　つかうと　めずらしい\nとくせいに　かえられる　パッチ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "일반적인 특성을 가진 포켓몬에게 사용하면\n희귀한 특성으로 바꿀 수 있는 패치.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用於擁有常見特性的寶可夢，\n就能把寶可夢的特性改變成\n稀有特性的膏藥。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un objet qui permet de remplacer le talent ordinaire\nd’un Pokémon par un talent rare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Pflaster, das es ermöglicht, die reguläre Fähigkeit\neines Pokémon zu einer seltenen Fähigkeit zu ändern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parche que permite cambiar la habilidad normal de un\nPokémon a otra menos común.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cerotto che permette a un Pokémon dotato\ndi un’abilità comune di cambiarla in una più rara.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A patch that allows a Pokémon with a regular Ability\nto have a rare Ability.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "通常の　特性を　持つ\nポケモンに　使うと　珍しい\n特性に　変えられる　パッチ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以改变宝可梦特性的膏药。\n给拥有常见特性的宝可梦使用后，\n其特性会转变为稀有特性。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parche que permite cambiar la habilidad normal de un\nPokémon a otra menos común.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
  ],
